      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some quick NPC templates to help you with world building:\n\n* Successful CEO: Ages 40-50, sharp business attire, always on his phone or laptop, polished smile and firm handshake. Possibly oblivious to the city's grittier side, but has a few influential connections that keep him well-known. Always seems to be rushing to a \"meeting\" or \"Client meeting\". Name: Victor LaPorte, Business Owner, Industry: Finance.\n* Friendly Neighbor: Aged 30-45, always wears a scarf or hood, has a kind smile and is eager to chat about the local events. Loves offering well-meaning advice and invitations to city gatherings. Has a hidden talent for cooking or playing music. Name: Samantha Rodriguez, Local Restaurant Owner, Personality: Kind-Hearted and Warm.\n* High-Ranking Police Officer: Strictly in uniform, stern expression, brass name tag, hand resting on holstered gun. Authoritative and somewhat intimidating, has experience handling tough cases. Eyes you warily, but might let their guard down for a trusted ally. Name: Sergeant Maria Rodriguez, NYPD, Position: Combat Supplement.\n* Suspicious Figure: Thin, hunched over figure in tattered clothes, undeterred expression",
